      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm not sure if the [IK 2.0 launch options](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/ik-20-features-and-options#new-launch-options) are now obsolete, but if you have `--freeze-tracking-on-disconnect` in your launch options, that launch option must be removed too.",
