  "details": "Description\n\nWhen I turn off the Vive Tracker, the sit/stand toggle button becomes grayed out and cannot be pressed. As a result, I can no longer toggle between sitting and standing using the three-point system.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nEither restart VRChat or don't switch between full tracking and 3-point tracking. Rejoining didn't fix the issue.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: アバター\n\n- Frequency: Once\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-19_01-59-55.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_8739f9f4-2074-4028-8b29-c27e91fe7818/1/file)",
